{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/6bf484899d3cd5bd5a6347df2cd6be66.poster.avif?t=1772970386\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/6bf484899d3cd5bd5a6347df2cd6be66.webm?t=1772970386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a team of mythical heroes and battle it out in a space-time twisted tavern against other players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/c3adba8de57024773b7732a33b3eb118.avif?t=1772970386\" width=385 height=102 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/4c5ebc51c35df2fd64d7c462b3034ff4.poster.avif?t=1772970386\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/4c5ebc51c35df2fd64d7c462b3034ff4.webm?t=1772970386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon deities from Olympus, mighty warriors from Asgard,\u8d85\u51e1 martial artists from the East, and even hidden Cthulhu followers\u2014each hero boasts exquisite hand-drawn artwork and possesses unique passive skills and growth paths. Freely build your dream lineup, whether it\u2019s a 3-hero rush squad, a 5-unit control group, or a hyper-carry solo build\u2014the choices are all yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/56ececa8f30b8b828ca83a0a210eba82.avif?t=1772970386\" width=420 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/ed43e1210213aa3b3f992b953bc31608.poster.avif?t=1772970386\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/ed43e1210213aa3b3f992b953bc31608.webm?t=1772970386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current version features over 75 collectible cards, including 52 mythical heroes and 23 varied attribute cards with unique effects. And this is only the beginning\u2014new heroes such as Egyptian gods and beasts from the Classic of Mountains and Seas are already in development. Your collection will keep growing, with endless strategic possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/62e72873363ce8cfe25925777ca79810.avif?t=1772970386\" width=446 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/d95665fa11f7de35174f9e94d5889252.poster.avif?t=1772970386\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/d95665fa11f7de35174f9e94d5889252.webm?t=1772970386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just about placing units randomly. Frontline positioning affects damage taken, back row influences firepower, flanking can trigger pincer attacks, and certain adjacent heroes can activate hidden bonds\u2014drastically boosting stats or even granting extra skills! One clever move can turn the tide; one misstep could cost everything. True strategy begins the moment you place your units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/6c5898b6b2b1b582b34e0f6fef364e26.avif?t=1772970386\" width=541 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/3e89bfccd6471379b85877f2ac7cbef4.poster.avif?t=1772970386\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/3e89bfccd6471379b85877f2ac7cbef4.webm?t=1772970386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unique summoners are ready\u2014each can reshape the battlefield on a fundamental level! Pick the right commander that fits your lineup to maximize your legion\u2019s combat power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/419cdff1512020c24610ed25da73c33e.avif?t=1772970386\" width=459 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/96f53661d3e0fed2f401d45d273a12a0.poster.avif?t=1772970386\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/96f53661d3e0fed2f401d45d273a12a0.webm?t=1772970386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the global asynchronous ranked ladder and challenge preserved lineups of real players! Whether you prefer the fierce aggression of \u201cLifesteal comp,\u201d the snowballing economy of \u201cGold rush,\u201d the stubborn defense of \u201cShield reflect,\u201d or the eerie escalation of \u201cHero consume\u201d\u2014every strategy can reach the top. Every victory boosts your rank. With seasonal resets and generous rewards, prove to the world who the true Auto Chess grand strategist is!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3242010?t=1772970386","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772970386","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/8683c95202cfd43bba077929f1b2b6f34694484b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772970386","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/8683c95202cfd43bba077929f1b2b6f34694484b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772970386","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4047540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242010/extras/6bf484899d3cd5bd5a6347df2cd6be66.poster.avif